        "quote": "In an action to recover damages for personal injuries, etc., the plaintiffs appeal, as limited by their brief, from so much an order of the Supreme Court, Suffolk County (Spinner, J.), entered February 19, 2013, as granted the defendants' motion for summary judgment dismissing the complaint.",
